# floating-section-nav.js — Floating Section Navigation

## Layman's terms

Makes a floating nav that follows you as you scroll, showing which section you're in. Lets you jump between sections (e.g. membership tiers, FAQ) with a sticky nav bar.

## Medium understanding

Template component for section-based navigation. Typically highlights current section based on scroll position and provides click-to-scroll links. Used in long pages with multiple sections. Copy to Dev when building new pages.

## Advanced

- **Location:** Templates/Components/Buttons/Floating Buttons/Floating Section Nav/
- **Template:** Not live; used as scaffold
